{"In the test loop creating 20 IDPs, the cleanup always targets the literal alias \"alias\" instead of the actual created alias, so none of the IDPs are ever removed, polluting the shared test realm and leaking state into subsequent tests.": 0.9782667756080627, "If the alias no longer exists, idpDelegate.getByAlias returns null, but registerIDPInvalidation(storedIdp) is still called, causing a NullPointerException. Need to guard against null model before registering invalidations to keep repeated removals idempotent.": 0.6074159741401672}